  "privacy-policy": {
    "content": "<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>\n<p>Last updated: 2026</p>\n<p>\nThis Privacy Policy describes Our policies and procedures on the collection, use and disclosure of Your information when You use the ReadmeForge Service.\n</p>\n<p>\nReadmeForge operates as a client-side open-source application and respects your privacy. For inquiries, contact support@readmeforge.dev.\n</p>"
